# The data tables are round-tripped through spreadsheet apps (Numbers, Excel),
# which often export CRLF. Normalize to LF on commit so a re-export doesn't show
# up as a whole-file diff. The build parser accepts either, so this is cosmetic.
data/*.csv text eol=lf
assets/data/hardware-data.json text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
